<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρᾰτεινός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lovely,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly of places, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.532
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.210
			</span></i>, al.; also of things, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠνορέη,
				φιλότης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				6.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.300
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					6.85
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					122.7
				</span></i>
			 : rarely of persons, and then mostly of women, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγείνατο παῖδ᾽ ἐρατεινήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.13
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				423
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				909
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμηλικίη ἐ.</span> her
				<i>lovely</i> companions, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.175
			</span></i> ; of Polyphemus, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἀρ᾽ ἔμελλ᾽
				ἑτάροισι φανεὶς ἐ. ἔσεσθαι</span> a <i>welcome,
			glad</i> sight to my comrades, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.230
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			and Lyr.word : epith. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
